# =============================================================================
# Streamlit Secrets Template — MapBiomas GIF Factory
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to secrets.toml and fill in the values.
# DO NOT commit secrets.toml to git (it's in .gitignore).
#
# The app can work without any secrets if the GCS bucket is public
# (it falls back to HTTP URLs for index.json).
# =============================================================================

